  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math><br />We get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now finding the integration we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Using partial fraction we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>On solving we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Now solution of differential equation is given by</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now given curve passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, curve becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
